{"title": "Valve Index", "parts": {"lead": "<p class=lead>VR headset from Valve with a front global-shutter fisheye stereo pair and a 6-axis IMU at about 1 kHz, solved from the Monado SLAM calibration data.</p><div class=chips><span class=chip>Global shutter</span><span class=chip>Stereo fisheye</span><span class=chip>1 kHz IMU</span><span class=chip>CC BY 4.0</span></div>", "glance": "<p>VR headset from Valve with a front global-shutter fisheye stereo pair and a 6-axis IMU at about 1 kHz, solved from the Monado SLAM calibration data.</p><div class=band><figure class=demo><video src=\"/media/hero/hero_mic_960.mp4\" poster=\"/media/hero/hero_mic_960.jpg\" autoplay muted loop playsinline controls preload=metadata></video><figcaption>Recovered by MVIS from the Monado calibration data.</figcaption></figure><div class=v data-v=\"0\"><div class=tiles><div><span>Reprojection median</span><b>0.19<small> px</small></b></div><div><span>cam0–cam1 baseline</span><b>133.7<small> mm</small></b></div><div><span>cam0 td</span><b>−0.03<small> ms</small></b></div><div><span>cam0 lever arm</span><b>140.2<small> mm</small></b></div></div></div></div><p class=sd-note>One recording shown, with no independent reference on this page. These values show what MVIS solved, not how close they are to the truth.</p>", "process": "<p>The solved path of the rig around the board. Press Play or drag the bar to follow the calibration. Camera images are left out to keep the page small.</p><div class=v data-v=\"0\"><div class=procplot id=\"proc0\"></div><div class=\"mvis-progress\" data-plot=\"proc0\"><button type=button>▶ Play</button><select class=\"mvis-progress-cam\" aria-label=\"Camera shown\"><option value=\"0\">cam0</option><option value=\"1\">cam1</option></select><input type=range min=0 max=599 value=599 step=1 aria-label=\"Calibration progress\"><span class=\"mvis-progress-label\">Loading</span></div></div>", "map": "<p>Solved positions and orientations, to scale in the IMU frame. Drag sideways to orbit. Tap a sensor for its values.</p><div class=map><div class=stage><canvas id=rig tabindex=0 aria-label=\"3D map of the cameras and IMU\"></canvas><div class=tools><button data-view=iso type=button>3D</button><button data-view=front type=button>Front</button><button data-view=top type=button>Top</button><button data-view=side type=button>Side</button><button data-z=1 type=button aria-label=\"Zoom in\">+</button><button data-z=-1 type=button aria-label=\"Zoom out\">−</button></div></div><div class=panel><div class=picks id=picks></div><div id=info></div></div></div>", "hardware": "<div class=scroll><table><thead><tr><th>Item</th><th>Value</th><th>Source</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Cameras</td><td>2 × 960×960 at 54 Hz, grayscale</td><td><span class=chip>Dataset</span></td></tr><tr><td>Shutter</td><td>Global</td><td><span class=chip>Dataset</span></td></tr><tr><td>Lens</td><td>Fisheye, about 120° (unofficial)</td><td><span class=chip>Dataset</span></td></tr><tr><td>IMU</td><td>6-axis, about 1 kHz</td><td><span class=chip>Dataset</span></td></tr><tr><td>Sensor part numbers</td><td>Not published</td><td><span class=chip>Unknown</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div><p class=note>Maker's specs from <a href=\"https://www.valvesoftware.com/en/index\">Valve Index page</a>, checked 2026-11-03.</p><p class=note>Company: <a href=\"https://www.valvesoftware.com/\">Valve</a>.</p>", "dataset": "<div class=two><div class=scroll><table><tbody><tr><td>Recording</td><td>Monado MIC, imucalib1</td></tr><tr><td>Source</td><td>Monado SLAM Datasets, Collabora</td></tr><tr><td>Board</td><td>AprilGrid 6×6, tag 30 mm, spacing 0.3, t36h11</td></tr><tr><td>Licence</td><td>CC BY 4.0</td></tr><tr><td>Data</td><td><a href=\"https://huggingface.co/datasets/collabora/monado-slam-datasets\">Monado SLAM Datasets</a></td></tr></tbody></table></div><div><figure class=board><svg viewBox=\"-18.0 -18.0 261.0 261.0\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"AprilGrid 6 by 6, to scale\"><rect x=\"-18.0\" y=\"-